# Local secrets. Git-ignored (.gitignore) — do not commit, do not paste into a chat or a screenshot.
#
# HOW TO LOAD IT. Nothing in this repo reads .env automatically — there is no dotenv dependency.
# Pick one:
#
#   node --env-file=
#   set -a; source .env; set +a                                                  # exports into the current shell
#
# WHAT ACTUALLY READS THESE. Only ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is consumed today, by
# analysis/lib/llm-head.mjs (via analysis/classify-cookies.mjs). Without it that tool falls back
# to --rules-only and emits the deterministic prior instead of an LLM-refined verdict. The OpenAI
# and Google entries below have NO consumer in this repo yet — they are here because you asked for
# them, not because anything will pick them up.

# ---- Anthropic — the cookie classifier's LLM head -------------------------------------------
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Overrides the head's model. The default in llm-head.mjs is "claude-sonnet-5", whose id
# its own comment flags as never reconciled against the claude-api skill — worth confirming before
# a real run rather than discovering it as a 404 mid-batch.
# CLASSIFIER_MODEL=

# ---- OpenAI — no consumer in this repo yet ---------------------------------------------------
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# ---- Google — no consumer in this repo yet ---------------------------------------------------
# The VaultJS MCP's own classifier reports model "gemini-3-flash-preview", but that runs
# server-side inside the MCP; it does not read a key from here.
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
